          "**2. Endangered Species:** Species in danger of extinction. Survival is difficult if negative factors continue (black buck, crocodile, Indian wild ass, Indian rhino, lion-tailed macaque, sangai brow-antlered deer in Manipur).",
          "**3. Vulnerable Species:** Population has declined to levels from where it is likely to move into the endangered category if negative factors continue (blue sheep, Asiatic elephant, Gangetic dolphin).",
