          "• **Tehri Dam Andolan:** Resistance against the high dam on the Bhagirathi River in Uttarakhand.",
          "• **Inter-State Water Disputes:** Conflicts over sharing water and costs: **Krishna-Godavari dispute** (Karnataka and Andhra Pradesh governments objecting to Maharashtra diverting water at Koyna); **Cauvery dispute** between Karnataka and Tamil Nadu."
