          "Important crops: **Wheat, barley, peas, gram, mustard**.",
          "States: Punjab, Haryana, Himachal Pradesh, Jammu & Kashmir, Uttarakhand, and Uttar Pradesh. Availability of precipitation during winter months from western temperate cyclones aids these crops.",
          "**2. Kharif Crops:** Sown with the onset of monsoon (**June–July**) and harvested in **September–October**.",
          "Important crops: **Paddy (rice), maize, jowar, bajra, tur (arhar), moong, urad, cotton, jute, groundnut, soybean**.",
