          "• **Zilla Parishad:** All panchayat samitis in a district constitute the Zilla Parishad. Headed politically by the **Zilla Parishad Chairperson**; MPs and MLAs of the district are members.",
          "**Urban Local Government:** **Municipalities** in towns; **Municipal Corporations** in big cities. Municipalities headed by Municipal Chairperson; Municipal Corporation headed by a **Mayor**."
